# Users
# Turn on debug to use these.

###
# @name login
POST {{endpoint}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
# @name get_me
GET {{endpoint}}/api/users/me


###
# @name logout
POST {{endpoint}}/api/users/logout
Content-Type: application/json
